dialect protocol stdio.md.mutations
; 🧬️ Binary op-log encoding of `MdMutation`: length-prefixed UTF-8 JSON matching the sibling
; ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio (real `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op` shape).
op-frame = length json-payload
length = u32-le
json-payload = utf8-bytes ; conforms to ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio `md-mutation`
